=== meta ===
bypass: 42
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: A selector added to an INI addopts continuation after an `=` option is read (#324)
origin: issue #324 I1: the reader stopped at `--cov-report=term` and read the value as
origin2: nothing on both sides, so the added `-m 'not slow'` passed at warn
=== before: setup.cfg ===
[tool:pytest]
addopts =
  --cov-report=term
  -rxXs
=== after: setup.cfg ===
[tool:pytest]
addopts =
  --cov-report=term
  -rxXs
  -m 'not slow'
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
